# Paths Cloudflare must not publish, even though Vite copied them into `dist/`.
# Vite mirrors `public/` wholesale, so anything a local workflow parks in there
# would otherwise ship — a deploy from a working tree is not a clean checkout.
# Wrangler reads this from the root of the assets directory and never serves the
# file itself.
#
# `.tmp/` is the sprite pipeline's scratch space: PNG masters and intermediates
# (see `.docs/sprites/README.md`). Gitignored, so CI never sees it.
.tmp/
